---
import Marketing from '../layouts/Marketing.astro';
---

<Marketing
  title="Grossline — pricing"
  description="A flat monthly fee based on what you spend on ads — never a cut of your sales. Three plans: Advisory, Growth, Partner. Your first report is free."
  path="/pricing"
>
  <div class="pagehead">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="eyebrow">Pricing</div>
      <h1>Based on what you spend on ads. <em>Never on what you sell.</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Most tools in this category take a slice of your revenue, so your bill climbs as you grow.
        We charge a flat monthly fee, and it doesn't move because you had a good quarter.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="pricing" style="margin-top:40px">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="tiers">
        <div class="tier">
          <div class="name">Advisory</div>
          <div class="for">Under $25k a month on ads</div>
          <div class="price">$549<span class="per">/mo</span></div>
          <ul>
            <li><b>One store</b></li>
            <li>Monthly report, <b>written by a person</b></li>
            <li><b>30-minute call</b> every month</li>
            <li>Alerts if something goes wrong mid-month</li>
            <li>We track whether our advice worked</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="btn outline-light" href="/free-report">Start free</a>
        </div>

        <div class="tier feature">
          <div class="tag">MOST CHOSEN</div>
          <div class="name">Growth</div>
          <div class="for">$25k–60k a month on ads</div>
          <div class="price">$949<span class="per">/mo</span></div>
          <ul>
            <li><b>Up to three stores</b>, in one view</li>
            <li>Monthly report, <b>written by a person</b></li>
            <li><b>45 minutes, every two weeks</b></li>
            <li>Weekly summary email</li>
            <li>Alerts tuned to your business</li>
            <li>Two questions a month, any time</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="btn" href="/free-report">Start free</a>
        </div>

        <div class="tier">
          <div class="name">Partner</div>
          <div class="for">$60k+ a month on ads</div>
          <div class="price">$1,800<span class="per">+ /mo</span></div>
          <ul>
            <li><b>Unlimited stores</b></li>
            <li><b>Weekly call</b></li>
            <li>Full history, as far back as it goes</li>
            <li>Ask us anything, any time</li>
            <li>Quarterly deep dive</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="btn outline-light" href="/contact">Talk to us</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="pricenote">
        <b>Your first report is free.</b> One month of data, one report, one call — then you decide.<br
        />
        Setup is $600 one time, and covers connecting everything and pulling 13 months of history. Extra
        stores are $129 a month. Billed every three months, in advance. No lock-in.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="eyebrow">What clients say</div>
      <h2>We'll put a real quote here.</h2>
      <div class="quote-slot">
        A client quote will go here once we have a real one worth quoting. We'd rather leave it empty
        than invent one.
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Marketing>

<style>
  /* Dark pricing section — mirrors the homepage's pricing block so the numbers
     match what a visitor already saw on the landing page. */
  .pricing {
    background: var(--gl-green-night);
    color: var(--gl-green-fog);
    padding: 72px 0;
  }
  .tiers {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 22px;
  }
  .tier {
    background: var(--gl-green-tier);
    border: 1px solid var(--gl-green-line-2);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 32px 28px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .tier.feature {
    background: var(--gl-white);
    color: var(--gl-ink);
    border-color: var(--gl-white);
    position: relative;
  }
  .tier .tag {
    position: absolute;
    top: -12px;
    left: 28px;
    background: var(--gl-gold-display);
    color: var(--gl-gold-text);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 5px 12px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }
  .tier .name {
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .tier .for {
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--gl-green-muted-2);
  }
  .tier.feature .for {
    color: var(--gl-slate);
  }
  .tier .price {
    margin-top: 26px;
    font-family: var(--gl-font-display);
    font-size: 46px;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .tier .per {
    font-family: var(--gl-font-body);
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--gl-green-muted-2);
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }
  .tier.feature .per {
    color: var(--gl-slate);
  }
  .tier ul {
    margin-top: 26px;
    list-style: none;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .tier li {
    padding: 11px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--gl-green-line-2);
    color: var(--gl-green-list);
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .tier.feature li {
    border-top-color: var(--gl-line);
    color: var(--gl-slate);
  }
  .tier li:before {
    content: '—';
    color: var(--gl-green-numeral);
    flex: none;
  }
  .tier.feature li:before {
    color: var(--gl-green);
  }
  .tier li b {
    color: var(--gl-white);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .tier.feature li b {
    color: var(--gl-ink);
  }
  .tier .btn {
    margin-top: 26px;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .pricenote {
    margin-top: 28px;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    color: var(--gl-green-muted-2);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .pricenote b {
    color: var(--gl-white);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .quote-slot {
    margin-top: 28px;
    border: 1.5px dashed var(--gl-line-2);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 34px;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--gl-slate);
    font-size: 15px;
    max-width: 680px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 1080px) {
    .tiers {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
